inition. Scholar IDs and linked research records are preserved."], [], ["Scholar ID", "Scholar Name", "Family Name", "Given Names", "Gender", "Alive / Deceased", "Paternal Island Division", "District Paternal", "Specific Island Paternal", "Village/Town Paternal (Kolo)", "Maternal Island Division", "District Maternal", "Specific Island Maternal", "Village/Town Maternal (Kolo)", "Estate / Chiefly Affiliation Paternal (Tofi'a)", "Estate / Chiefly Affiliation Maternal (Tofi'a)", "Ha'a / Lineage Paternal", "Ha'a / Lineage Maternal", "Kāinga Paternal", "Kāinga Maternal", "Self-identified Home / Community Affiliation Paternal", "Self-identified Home / Community Affiliation Maternal", "Lineage / Provenance Notes", "Primary Discipline / Field", "Current Title / Role", "Current Institution", "Institution Country", "Current Department / Unit", "Highest Completed Degree", "Current PG Status", "Degree Episodes", "International Degree Episodes", "Tonga Degree Episodes", "Funding Episodes", "Awards Count", "Gold Medals / Prizes Count", "Linked Publication Count", "First-Author Publication Count", "Current Leadership Category", "Current Leadership Level", "Current Profile URL", "ORCID / Researcher ID", "Google Scholar URL", "Review Status", "Roster Tier", "Source Basis", "BibTeX Author Match (roster)", "BibTeX Author Occurrences (roster)", "Name Variants / Aliases", "Record Notes"]], "Graduate Degrees": [["Graduate Degrees & Theses"], ["One row per postgraduate degree episode. Multiple Master's degrees remain separate; uncertainty is preserved rather than guessed."], [], ["Degree ID", "Scholar ID", "Scholar Name", "Degree Stage", "Degree / Qualification", "Field / Discipline", "Broad discipline", "C_Uni name", "O_Uni name", "Country", "International from Tonga?", "City", "Region", "Year / Status", "Completion Status", "Thesis / Research Title", "Thesis / Repository URL", "Evidence URL 1", "Evidence URL 2", "Verification", "Notes", "Start Year", "Finish / Completion Year", "Duration